// Ch15 B13 "The pyre-raft" (C, 2 min, no dialogue). act2_ch15.md §2 B13; ADR 0204 §12 (the pyre-raft
// reprises `hush_first_verse`) and §13 (Tobin's light caught in a Saltwright lamp, and something is still
// lost). H12: dusk in the flotilla's lee; Tobin on the raft under the bridal cloth, the wedding cord in his
// hands; all four thousand on the hulls, quiet. H13: Aldous Varrow pushes it off with his dock-hook; it is
// lit; it burns going out on the tide. Tobin's held motes drift low toward the hulls and into the salt-glass
// housing he holds up; he closes it (bound, steady). THE GLASS CRACKS in the raft's heat with a small sharp
// crack: a thread escapes, held, sideways over the water with the smoke, and is gone. H14: Asha watches; so
// does Pell, who turns his back to the water and to the lamp. Liss takes the cracked lamp and holds it.
title: ch15_pyre_raft
location: ch17/hollowmere
---
@letterbox on
@camera H12
@music hush_first_verse fade=3.0
@wait 5.0
@camera H13
@anim aldous_varrow push_off pyre_raft
@sfx hearth_crackle
@wait 4.0
@vfx glimmer_held at=pyre_raft count=6 rate=slow
@anim aldous_varrow raise lamp_housing
@wait 3.0
@sfx lamp_housing_close
@vfx glimmer_bound at=lamp_housing count=5
@wait 2.0
@sfx lamp_crack
@vfx glimmer_held at=lamp_crack count=1 rate=slow
@wait 3.0
@camera H14
@anim asha look_at lamp_housing
@wait 2.0
@anim pell turn_back
@wait 2.0
@anim liss take lamp_housing
@wait 4.0
@music silence fade=4.0
<<set $ch15_pyre_raft = true>>
@fade out 3.0
@letterbox off
===
